Theorem INT_2_DIVIDES_MUL : forall m n :e int, divides_int 2 (m * n) <-> divides_int 2 m \/ divides_int 2 n.
Admitted.

// HOL Light: int.ml:1869 / INT_2_DIVIDES_POW
